{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momo &amp; Dodo: MODO Card Mayhem!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo and Dodo are superstar streamers from the Demon Realm. During a routine broadcast, a mysterious network disruption forcibly ended their stream and plunged every demon into violent madness. The sisters then received an email from the enigmatic &quot;Dr. M,&quot; who entrusted them with a powerful card deck \u2013 the <strong>MODO Cards</strong>. Now, wielding these magical cards, they must battle through live streams to save their frenzied fans and fellow demons! As they investigate the network chaos, they begin to uncover shocking truths about their world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can summon different Magical Crystals (weapons) for battle by forming different card combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/bef899fad129339bc3d8c79f17310d8f.poster.avif?t=1759462256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/bef899fad129339bc3d8c79f17310d8f.webm?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/bef899fad129339bc3d8c79f17310d8f.mp4?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters also have awesome skills waiting for you to unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/6bb6cafe8b523dee035ec92c1fb43646.poster.avif?t=1759462256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/6bb6cafe8b523dee035ec92c1fb43646.webm?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/6bb6cafe8b523dee035ec92c1fb43646.mp4?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Antiquities to alter your cards and summon even more powerful Magical Crystals (weapons)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/4ecc6cd975efbe0cb560c3ee0dc57029.poster.avif?t=1759462256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/4ecc6cd975efbe0cb560c3ee0dc57029.webm?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/4ecc6cd975efbe0cb560c3ee0dc57029.mp4?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dodging enemy attacks, be careful of the map mechanics to avoid falling off or being knocked back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/8340ae36295525f8b2e47882975f5be4.poster.avif?t=1759462256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/8340ae36295525f8b2e47882975f5be4.webm?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/extras/8340ae36295525f8b2e47882975f5be4.mp4?t=1759462256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Adventure:</strong>  <br>Each chapter features specially produced story cutscenes \u2013 we encourage you to watch them all! Forge your own path through strategic card synergies and discover multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call for Collaborations!</strong>  <br>We welcome feedback, suggestions, and partnership opportunities! We're open to collaborations and will <strong>feature your original characters (OCs), VTubers, or game characters in our game \u2013 completely free!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932140?t=1759462256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932140?t=1759462256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/15592d173354e4317301b31bd2c006668e0cb5f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759462256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932140/15592d173354e4317301b31bd2c006668e0cb5f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759462256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4032590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momo &amp; Dodo: MODO Card Mayhem!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo and Dodo are superstar streamers from the Demon Realm. During a routine broadcast, a mysterious network disruption forcibly ended their stream and plunged every demon into violent madness. The sisters then received an email from the enigmatic &quot;Dr. M,&quot; who entrusted them with a powerful card deck \u2013 the <strong>MODO Cards</strong>. Now, wielding these magical cards, they must battle through live streams to save their frenzied fans and fellow demons! As they investigate the network chaos, they begin to uncover shocking truths about their world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can summon different Magical Crystals (weapons) for battle by forming different card combinations!</p>